## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant policy modeling
- Latency budgeting and SLA targets
- Model variant routing and cost-speed tradeoffs
- Redaction at prompt and response with data locality
- Tamper-evident auditing and drift detection

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo routing decision example
function decideRoute(ctx) {
  const tenant = ctx.tenant
  const policy = policyStore[tenant] || policyStore['default']
  // Evaluate latency and redact flags
  const model = policy.chooseModel(ctx.prompt)
  const redact = policy.shouldRedact(ctx.prompt)
  return { model, redact }
}
```

